# yanbiao-core

[![Run Tests](https://github.com/phungtienhung54-lab/yanbiao-core.git/actions/workflows/test.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/phungtienhung54-lab/yanbiao-core.git/actions/workflows/test.yml)
[![Coverage](https://img.shields.io/badge/coverage-99.78%25-brightgreen)]()
[![Python 3.12](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.12-blue.svg)]()
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](LICENSE)

> A human-in-the-loop sharded memory architecture to mitigate concept-drift for long-context LLM.

## ✨ 核心特性
- **分片记忆架构**：Layer 0 核心协议 / Layer 1 事实引擎 / Layer 2 信念系统 / Layer 3 沙盒引擎
- **用户隔离**：多用户/多会话信念数据完全隔离，无串台
- **事实校验**：PIF 防护（主观观点过滤）、交叉验证
- **高质量保障**：101 个测试用例，覆盖率 99.78%，GitHub Actions 自动运行

## 🚀 快速开始
### 安装依赖
\`\`\`bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
\`\`\`

### 运行测试
\`\`\`bash
pytest tests/ --cov=core --cov-branch --cov-fail-under=95
\`\`\`

